usage: audit-final-export-v2.py [-h] --complete-export-confirmed
                                --formal-release-confirmed
                                --binding-json BINDING_JSON [--run RUN]
                                [--export EXPORT_DIR] --output OUTPUT

Offline R20 complete-or-partial canonical export integrity/recount audit.
Never dispatches or grades models. Run only after canonical export is
complete. The mandatory confirmation flag is an operator gate, not a claim
that missing/incomplete evidence passed.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --complete-export-confirmed
  --formal-release-confirmed
  --binding-json BINDING_JSON
  --run RUN
  --export EXPORT_DIR
  --output OUTPUT
